1
00:00:00,415 --> 00:00:02,896
Most projects clear the forest, then plant saplings

2
00:00:03,208 --> 00:00:05,256
and call it green.

3
00:00:06,318 --> 00:00:09,586
Agartha sits on the Narsapur forest boundary.

4
00:00:10,352 --> 00:00:13,532
Native dry deciduous, already standing.

5
00:00:14,536 --> 00:00:17,446
The permaculture design works with that forest

6
00:00:17,832 --> 00:00:19,119
instead of replacing it.

7
00:00:19,907 --> 00:00:22,499
Paths bend around what was already growing.

8
00:00:23,640 --> 00:00:26,557
Stand in it and the loudest thing

9
00:00:27,201 --> 00:00:28,031
all day is birds.

10
00:00:29,277 --> 00:00:32,441
So — trees, or a forest?
